 `630` / `630`\n- existing page assets reused: `419` unique controlled assets / `688` page refs\n- new controlled page assets generated/registered: `0` / `0`\n- missing page asset blockers: `0`\n- dedupe prevented count: `269`\n- public/static URL allowed count: `0`\n- pre-attempt fetch allowed count: `0`\n- preload/bundle exposure count: `0`\n- git committed binary count: `0`\n- side-effect total count for production/model/crop/new-asset operations: `0`\n\nThe artifact also preserves the prior controlled package baseline: `424` unique generated page screenshots, `693` row-to-page refs, `269` prevented duplicates, and zero public/static/git exposure.\n\n## Artifacts\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-assets.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-assets.validator-result.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-assets.readback.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` -> exit 0; clean worktree; only known branch naming warning\n- `npm run method-map:build-post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-assets` -> validator_status `pass`\n- `node --experimental-vm-modules /home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-assets.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-question-level-page-range-locator.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-page-screenshot-assets.test.js` -> 3 suites / 41 tests pass\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-assets.mjs` -> syntax check passed\n- `git diff --check` -> passed\n\nNote: the isolated AO worktree has no local `node_modules`, so Jest was run through the dependency-bearing root checkout's Jest binary. ESLint could not be made meaningful from this worktree without installing local dependencies; the root checkout's ESLint ignores `.worktrees` paths.\n","created_at":"2026-07-09T16:38:55Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T16:54:22Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T16:54:22Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T16:54:22Z","merge_commit_sha":"2499a0531e4351142f30dc512a72830093250faf","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1527/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1527/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1527/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/a5ead42e7c13647e3ce00ffd9a2b672512634b3c","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1522","ref":"feat/issue-1522","sha":"a5ead42e7c13647e3ce00ffd9a2b672512634b3c","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":999357095,"node_id":"R_kgDOO5D6pw","name":"ciecop